WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Welcome to Build Your Digital Operating Plan. I’m

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.160
Brian Kennedy Jr. Your goal is a bounded

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:10.480
automation specification. Map one customer’s path from inquiry

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:12.720
to delivery and name the handoff that needs

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.000
attention. Keep your work private, record what you

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.800
tried, and set a review date. Do not

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:22.240
upload private data or authorize messages, charges or

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.920
account changes through a worksheet.
